----Intro of CCS
  removing the co2 which already in the atomsphere, to prevent the cumulative of co2, peel the co2 and transport them in other place
  the co2 is captured by the industry, and compressed. Then piped it to suitable storage sites. Before arrived to the place, where has 2300~2400 meters deepth(captain sandstone), it should pressed to liquid by tion well. Finally, the liquid would take the place of water that arounded by the rock, and the co2 is trapped within the rock.

----carbon balance and overshoot
      -the quarter of the green gas is come out the energy sector: agriculture, and forestry
        because the green gas would release by these activity. (N2O, CH4)
      -the releasing by the agriculture can not be effected by the improvement of the renewable energy.
          solution: we have to use CCS to reduce or offset the negative effect by these emissions.
----Climate Tipping Points
       overshooting the carbon budget will cause ireverisble change && domino effect when the temperature rises were below 2 degree C.
       easy to let whole climate systems deteriorates (lower the critical temperature thresholds at which each tipping point) if the rising temperature is higher than 2 degree C.
----Ways to use CCS
      bio-energy with CCS:-trees absorb CO2--> cut trees to drive(❌ CCS)-->CO2 released during industrial process(carbon neutral)
                              during this process, the increasing of CO2 is zero. Because the trees previously captured some CO2 from the atomsphere, and then released it back again after the industrial processing.
                          -trees absorb CO2--> cut trees to drive(✅ CCS)-->CO2 is collected and sent to geological storage (carbon nagative)
                              during this process, the difference from before is that the CO2 is stored in deep underground.
